---
kind: lore
id: post
title: The post office
components: [../components/postcard.component.lute]
---

/* The franking machine is a puzzle you can fail and retry: it stays until it
   is fixed (`spentBy`, 0.27). Then one postcard a day (`once: day` + one
   `share` key across the three template uses). */

<beat id="machine" on="placeVisit" target="place.post" title="The franking machine" priority="20" after="visited('post.mira.meet')" when="holds('present', ['mira', 'post'])" spentBy="run.machineFixed">
  ::auto{character="mira" anchor="left" action="fadeInUp"}
  ::set{run.seen.mira = run.day}
  @mira{emotion="tired"}: It's eaten another one. I can hear it chewing.
  <branch id="machineFix" prompt="The franking machine hums at you.">
    <choice id="thump" label="Thump it.">
      @narrator: It swallows the stamp you were holding. Mira sighs the sigh of a woman who has tried this.
    </choice>
    <choice id="reed" label="Poke a length of green reed into the roller." when="run.lantern.frame">
      ::set{run.machineFixed = true}
      @narrator: Something clicks. The machine spits out eleven stamps, a paperclip, and a very old toffee.
      @mira{emotion="surprised"}: Since EASTER.
    </choice>
  </branch>
  ::auto{character="mira" action="fadeOut"}
</beat>

<beat use="postcard" id="mum" to="mum" rank="12">
  @sol{mono}: Dear Mum. The sea is very big. Aunt Pell is fine. I am fine. Love, me.
</beat>

<beat use="postcard" id="gran" to="gran" rank="11">
  @sol{mono}: Dear Gran. They still do the Lantern Walk. Pell says you started it. Is that true?
</beat>

<beat use="postcard" id="maya" to="maya" rank="10">
  @sol{mono}: Maya. Nothing happens here. (Something might be happening here.) Tell you in September.
</beat>

<beat id="noticed" on="placeVisit" target="place.post" also once="run" title="Your name on the board" when="quest.postcards.state == 'complete'">
  @narrator: On the board behind the counter, in Mira's felt-tip: POSTCARD OF THE WEEK — SOL (THREE!!).
</beat>

<entry id="miraBark" on="placeVisit" target="place.post" category="bark" when="holds('present', ['mira', 'post'])" once="day">
  @mira: Morning, afternoon, whichever it is. The van's at four.
</entry>

<entry id="miraBusy" on="placeVisit" target="place.post" category="bark" priority="-1" when="holds('present', ['mira', 'post'])">
  @mira: Queue's out the door, love. Well. Queue's you.
</entry>

<entry id="postShut" on="placeVisit" target="place.post" category="bark" when="!holds('present', ['mira', 'post'])">
  @narrator: CLOSED. The letter box by the door says LAST COLLECTION 4PM SATURDAY in letters older than you.
</entry>
